  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Death Penalty Project: Promoting human rights standards in criminal justice systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop and promote human rights standards in criminal justice systems in death penalty retentionist and abolitionist de facto countries by improving access to justice and evidence-based research to generate discussion on capital punishment and abolition.</narrative>
  </description>
